  "prefLabel": "Rev 302.15 Professional Limited Liability Companies",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 302.15 Professional Limited Liability Companies. A professional limited liability company conducting business activity in New Hampshire shall determine its filing requirement, gross business profits, and apportionment of income in the same manner as a limited liability company.\n\nSource. #8709, eff 8-25-06 (formerly Rev 302.13); ss by #10758, eff 1-16-15 (formerly Rev 302.16); ss by #14231, eff 4-3-25, EXPIRES 4-3-35",
